WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Marilla's right that Anne will explain her lessons in great detail.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.720
I don't think Anne has ever used ten words when a hundred would do.

3
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.840
Think back to the first chapters of this book.

4
00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:17.680
On the buggy ride from Bright River, Anne told Matthew how much she hated her red

5
00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:18.000
hair.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.560
When Mrs.

7
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:23.280
Lynde made fun of it, Anne stamped her foot and shouted at her.

8
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:28.320
When Gilbert called her "Carrots," she broke her slate over his head.

9
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:33.520
So her hair has been at the center of some of her biggest moments.

10
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:39.440
For Anne, changing it would mean getting rid of something that has hurt her since

11
00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.880
she was little.

12
00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:47.120
As you read, see if you can feel how badly she wants it, even when you can guess it

13
00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:48.080
won't go well.

